`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"For a task like that to finish, the work has to keep running after you walk away. You also need a way to check on it and answer Claude from somewhere else. Remote Control and a cloud session both let you check in from your phone or a browser. They differ in where the work runs, and that decides what Claude can reach while you're away."}),`
